      <strong><a href=\"/member/HFX3389\">HFX3389</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 12:34:06 +08:00\">19h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>&gt; 就想用苹果充值</p><p>那你避免不了...必交...</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147496\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5341/067b/92597_normal.png?m=1773058053\" alt=\"HFX3389\" data-uid=\"92597\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HFX3389\">HFX3389</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 12:36:23 +08:00\">19h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/mizkan\">mizkan</a> #7 这是商店抽成，不是州税，只要走商店就必交，O\\选择自己背这个 30%的商店抽成，但 A\\选择让用户背</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147518\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fa70/42da/194163_normal.png?m=1749184790\" alt=\"potatowish\" data-uid=\"194163\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/potatowish\">potatowish</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 12:52:10 +08:00\">19h 16m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>中国用户老老实实交了吧，经常被封，封了第一次可以退</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147547\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bedf/40df/438004_normal.png?m=1786379099\" alt=\"docx\" data-uid=\"438004\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/docx\">docx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 13:24:00 +08:00\">18h 44m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不用 IAP 就解决了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147555\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/612b/2735/130165_normal.png?m=1786797253\" alt=\"akring\" data-uid=\"130165\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/akring\">akring</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 13:27:47 +08:00\">18h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有条件用自己的信用卡付，苹果也不一定给你退款，所以没啥优势</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147560\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/612b/2735/130165_normal.png?m=1786797253\" alt=\"akring\" data-uid=\"130165\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/akring\">akring</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 13:31:06 +08:00\">18h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以及楼上说的几乎都不对，苹果税客观存在，包括 20 刀的基础入门版也是要交苹果税的，但是 A\\ 和 O\\ 为了拉拢客户 + 金额不大所以自愿承担了。<br>100 刀和 200 刀的套餐厂商不愿意自己消化这 30%的苹果税，所以直接在定价上加上了这部分钱，相当于直接转嫁给了用户端，所以在定价上才能看得出贵了不少。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147584\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f8df6c11f09cfe84cba114f98f24da53?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"DearFox\" data-uid=\"717268\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/DearFox\">DearFox</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 13:44:18 +08:00\">18h 24m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/akring\">akring</a> 我以为普遍都是 iPhone 了,结果上面这些回复我不知道是没用 iPhone 还是没买过 Claude</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147592\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f9e8/0e8c/707007_normal.png?m=1784532508\" alt=\"mizkan\" data-uid=\"707007\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mizkan\">mizkan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 13:49:22 +08:00\">18h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/akring\">akring</a> 不是大哥我直接买的 CHATGPT 啊，先买礼品卡然后直接充，填的俄亥俄州。<br>流程我自己跑的我就是很清楚记得我只充了 20 刀然后充了一个月。</p><p>以及 OP 你嘴这么臭就活该吧自己想办法好了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147611\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/612b/2735/130165_normal.png?m=1786797253\" alt=\"akring\" data-uid=\"130165\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/akring\">akring</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 14:04:16 +08:00\">18h 4m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/mizkan\">mizkan</a> #18 你有没有看我的回复啊，20 刀的也是有苹果税的，只是厂商没转嫁给你自己消化了而已</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147960\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/02bc/55c3/620210_normal.png?m=1791077978\" alt=\"xxzhaoming\" data-uid=\"620210\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xxzhaoming\">xxzhaoming</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 18:55:47 +08:00\">13h 12m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>安卓好像也是 120 美金的 5 倍 max 啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148133\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f785579431043c2b3c862028d74fddb8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fovecifer\" data-uid=\"91522\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fovecifer\">fovecifer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 21:35:51 +08:00\">10h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>124.99 刀，近似是 125 刀，所以楼主你是想把 25 刀省掉吧？<br>确实有办法，但是不能既要又要</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148222\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffcefa5cd29e69847896180b55a04935?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hhh6\" data-uid=\"507199\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n            